+### Validation classes
+
+The validation keys ship whole in one partial after the vertical rule in the components layer: the
+`.was-validated` scope, the `.is-valid` and `.is-invalid` classes, and the feedback and tooltip
+elements each state reveals. The partial writes each state's cascade from the same loop over the
+state list, because the release emits them from one mixin as well.
+
+A state paints through the `--bs-form-valid-*` and `--bs-form-invalid-*` aliases the theme mixin
